# Variant tiers-2026-09-24-mid — the same settings as tiers-2026-09-24 (every tier on Opus 5.5:
# mid `medium`, strong `high`, max `xhigh`), under its own name so it gets its own branch and
# base: the driver ignores `--base` once a variant branch exists.
# Start it with `--base plan-base/call-audio-routes`, the benchmark base, and run steps 1 and 2
# only (`--to 2`): it measures the mid tier, Opus at `medium` against variant c (Fable at
# `medium`, same steps, same base). Judge on, as in c.
# Protocol and earlier results: scripts/plan-runner/benchmark.md
MODEL_MAX=opus
EFFORT_MAX=xhigh
ADVISOR_MAX=
MODEL_STRONG=opus
EFFORT_STRONG=high
ADVISOR_STRONG=
MODEL_MID=opus
EFFORT_MID=medium
ADVISOR_MID=
JUDGE_MODEL=opus
JUDGE_EFFORT=high
